          <tr><td>Metastability (<code>scripts/02</code>)</td><td><Tex src={String.raw`s = 1`} />, dimension 2, one step size <Tex src={String.raw`h = 0.05`} />; <Tex src={String.raw`\mu`} /> from 2.0 to 5.0; 32 chains × 150,000 steps, thin 1, burn-in 20%; all chains start in the left well; fits on separations with at least 20 crossings</td></tr>
